                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="changedBox" value="WHAT CHANGED vs. TODAY&#10;• Automation System orchestrates intake → confirmation → notification; the representative handles exceptions only.&#10;• Eligibility-gated: only the no-paperwork cohort is automated; the rest is routed to a human and tracked.&#10;• Web-form-first confirmation (signed, data-minimized page); AI voice is the fallback rung, not the first move.&#10;• Confirmation Ladder is enforced &amp; lead-time-aware — no &quot;one-and-done,&quot; never runs past the requested slot.&#10;• A Work Order is issued before any &quot;confirmed&quot; message — closes the &quot;turned away with no work order&quot; failure.&#10;• Per-channel consent + AI-disclosure on every outbound message (TCPA); &quot;confirmed&quot; reserved for real appointments.&#10;• Unconfirmed customers are proactively warned not to show up." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#2e5a2e;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=8;arcSize=4;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="690" y="995" width="680" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
